   "endMs": 3329,
   "level": "line"
  },
  {
   "text": "Nuwe aand by die koffiewinkel",
   "startMs": 13200,
   "endMs": 19705,
   "level": "line"
  },
  {
   "text": "Dik mis laat huise oplos. [musiek]",
   "startMs": 15480,
   "endMs": 19705,
   "level": "line"
  },
  {
   "text": "Ek dwaal deur die woonbuurte waar herinneringe is",
   "startMs": 20320,
   "endMs": 26200,
   "level": "line"
  },
  {
   "text": "maak my mal",
   "startMs": 23080,
   "endMs": 26200,
   "level": "line"
  },
  {
   "text": "Waar in die warm lente",
   "startMs": 26400,
   "endMs": 32095,
   "level": "line"
  },
  {
   "text": "Winter bedek die siel",
   "startMs": 29040,
   "endMs": 33320,
   "level": "line"
  },
  {
   "text": "[musiek]",
   "startMs": 32095,
   "endMs": 36760,
   "level": "line"
  },
  {
   "text": "Waar die lewe soos 'n pyl verby datums, verbygevlieg het",
   "startMs": 33320,
   "endMs": 38645,
   "level": "line"
  },
  {
   "text": "ons",
   "startMs": 36760,
   "endMs": 39160,
   "level": "line"
  },
  {
   "text": "[musiek]",
   "startMs": 38645,
   "endMs": 43080,
   "level": "line"
  },
  {
   "text": "Ons het papiere opgegaar en vergeet hoekom ons",
   "startMs": 39160,
   "endMs": 45520,
   "level": "line"
  },
  {
   "text": "ons leef",
   "startMs": 43080,
   "endMs": 45520,
   "level": "line"
  },
  {
   "text": "En dit het altyd gelyk, [musiek]",
   "startMs": 45720,
   "endMs": 52200,
   "level": "line"
  },
  {
   "text": "daar is steeds 'n C-klank voor",
   "startMs": 47240,
   "endMs": 52200,
   "level": "line"
  },
  {
   "text": "[musiek]",
   "startMs": 52400,
   "endMs": 54560,
   "level": "line"
  },
  {
   "text": "Net geleende tyd",
   "startMs": 52600,
   "endMs": 58520,
   "level": "line"
  },
  {
   "text": "gee niks",
   "startMs": 54560,
   "endMs": 58520,
   "level": "line"
  },
  {
   "text": "En skielik val [musiek] op my hart",
   "startMs": 59240,
   "endMs": 64440,
   "level": "line"
  },
  {
   "text": "koue ys",
   "startMs": 61800,
   "endMs": 68960,
   "level": "line"
  },
  {
   "text": "Ons leer om [musiek] te waardeer wanneer ons verloor",
   "startMs": 64440,
   "endMs": 72200,
   "level": "line"
  },
  {
   "text": "wanneer iemand se lig agter die deur uitgaan",
   "startMs": 68960,
   "endMs": 74670,
   "level": "line"
  },
  {
   "text": "Ons waai agter die vertrekkende treine aan, en probeer",
   "startMs": 72200,
   "endMs": 75240,
   "level": "line"
  },
  {
   "text": "[musiek]",
   "startMs": 74670,
   "endMs": 78320,
   "level": "line"
  },
  {
   "text": "smeek die verlede vir 'n antwoord",
   "startMs": 75240,
   "endMs": 81920,
   "level": "line"
  },
  {
   "text": "Ons leer om lief te hê wanneer dit koud is, [musiek]",
   "startMs": 78320,
   "endMs": 85000,
   "level": "line"
  },
  {
   "text": "wanneer daar as in jou handpalms is, nie staal nie. OOR",
   "startMs": 81920,
   "endMs": 86360,
   "level": "line"
  },
  {
   "text": "as ek maar net vooraf geweet het, [musiek]",
   "startMs": 85000,
   "endMs": 90000,
   "level": "line"
  },
  {
   "text": "hoe hierdie deursigtige een in die siel sal pyn",
   "startMs": 86360,
   "endMs": 91840,
   "level": "line"
  },
  {
   "text": "hartseer",
   "startMs": 90000,
   "endMs": 94320,
   "level": "line"
  },
  {
   "text": "Hy het nie gesê, [musiek] hy het nie omhels nie, hy het nie tyd gehad nie",
   "startMs": 91840,
   "endMs": 97840,
   "level": "line"
  },
  {
   "text": "Dit is 'n ewige motief",
   "startMs": 94320,
   "endMs": 101120,
   "level": "line"
  },
  {
   "text": "Ek het alles vir later gespaar, my hart is nie vir ander nie",
   "startMs": 97840,
   "endMs": 103545,
   "level": "line"
  },
  {
   "text": "oopgemaak. [musiek]",
   "startMs": 101120,
   "endMs": 103545,
   "level": "line"
  },
  {
   "text": "Ons veg teen die skaduwee",
   "startMs": 104000,
   "endMs": 106520,
   "level": "line"
  },
  {
   "text": "[musiek]",
   "startMs": 106111,
   "endMs": 110480,
   "level": "line"
  },
  {
   "text": "ons brand uit oor leë onbenullighede",
   "startMs": 106520,
   "endMs": 113316,
   "level": "line"
  },
  {
   "text": "En jy kan nie sien hoe die ryp gaan lê nie",
   "startMs": 110480,
   "endMs": 113880,
   "level": "line"
  },
  {
   "text": "[musiek]",
   "startMs": 113316,
   "endMs": 116960,
   "level": "line"
  },
  {
   "text": "op ons skouers",
   "startMs": 113880,
   "endMs": 119211,
   "level": "line"
  },
  {
   "text": "Maar geluk lê nie in die glinster van 'n winkelvenster nie",
   "startMs": 116960,
   "endMs": 121800,
   "level": "line"
  },
  {
   "text": "[musiek] nie in 'n bondel note nie, maar in 'n stil",
   "startMs": 119211,
   "endMs": 125040,
   "level": "line"
  },
  {
   "text": "die waarheid van familielede, in hul warmte te midde van die storms. Maar",
   "startMs": 121800,
   "endMs": 126880,
   "level": "line"
  },
  {
   "text": "ons waardeer net wat [musiek] reeds is",
   "startMs": 125040,
   "endMs": 129920,
   "level": "line"
  },
  {
   "text": "onmoontlik om terug te keer",
   "startMs": 126880,
   "endMs": 132600,
   "level": "line"
  },
  {
   "text": "Gaan voort met my lang",
   "startMs": 129920,
   "endMs": 135760,
   "level": "line"
  },
  {
   "text": "en dikwels is [musiek] 'n betekenislose pad",
