   "startMs": 145880,
   "endMs": 153160,
   "level": "line"
  },
  {
   "text": "Ons leer om [musiek] lief te hê wanneer dit afgekoel het",
   "startMs": 149520,
   "endMs": 155000,
   "level": "line"
  },
  {
   "text": "wanneer daar as in die handpalms is, [musiek] en nie",
